@startuml system-architecture
' Created by GPT-6.1-Sol on behalf of Nico running in codex.
title Digital stethoscope — current system architecture
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

actor Operator
cloud "Acoustic input" as Sound
node "PC / serial terminal\nEvaluation tools" as PC
cloud "Wi-Fi network" as Wifi
node "FHIR server" as FHIR
node "Time server" as Time

rectangle "Digital stethoscope / evaluation carrier Rev A" {
  component "INMP441\nMEMS microphone" as Mic
  node "ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 N16R8\nZephyr evaluation firmware\n16 MB flash / 8 MB PSRAM (module capacity)" as MCU
  component "PCM5102A\nLine-output DAC" as DAC
  component "Button + status LED" as Button
  component "Filter + speed switches" as Switches
  component "Potentiometer\nVolume control" as Pot
  component "ILI9341 TFT + backlight" as Display
  component "XPT2046 touch" as Touch
  storage "SD card\nFAT volume /SD:" as SD
}
component "Headphone amplifier\nAssembly dependency / verify stage" as Amp #FFF2CC
actor "Listener / headphones" as Listener

Sound --> Mic : sound
Mic --> MCU : I2S0 RX\n16 kHz / 32-bit slots
MCU --> DAC : I2S1 TX\nmono duplicated to L/R
DAC --> Amp : analog line level
Amp --> Listener : audio
Operator --> Button
Operator --> Switches
Operator --> Pot
Operator --> Touch
Button --> MCU : GPIO input
MCU --> Button : GPIO LED output
Switches --> MCU : GPIO inputs
Pot --> MCU : ADC1
MCU --> Display : SPI2 / MIPI-DBI\nPWM backlight
Touch --> MCU : SPI2 + PENIRQ
MCU <--> SD : shared SPI2\nseparate chip select
PC <--> MCU : USB-UART bridge\nconsole / shell / PCM fixtures
MCU ..> Wifi : optional network build\nexplicit Wi-Fi connection
Wifi ..> FHIR : verified TLS / HTTPS\nFHIR Observation
Wifi ..> Time : SNTP

legend bottom
  Solid links: configured local interfaces, not proof of physical acceptance.
  Dashed links: optional networking; default firmware is offline.
  Display, touch and SD share SPI2 with separate CS lines.
  Speed switch and SD wiring remain outside the recorded wiring confirmation.
endlegend
footer Created by GPT-6.1-Sol on behalf of Nico running in codex.
@enduml
